{"repositoryId":1255508738,"availability":"available","full":"salasebas/saml-rs","name":"saml-rs","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":6,"forks":3,"created":"2026-05-31T23:02:58Z","updated":"2026-10-12T06:38:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://samlrs.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://samlrs.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.387Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.387Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.387Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.387Z","stars":6,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pure-Rust SAML 2.0 service provider and identity provider support for browser Web SSO, metadata, and Single Logout. XML-DSig, XML-Enc, C14N, and detached message signatures go through bergshamra. The crate does not need libxml2, xmlsec1, or an OpenSSL build chain.","The Cargo package is saml-rs. The Rust import path is samlrs. Source and issues live in salasebas/saml-rs. Guides are at samlrs.vercel.app.","Status: pre-1.0. A minor release can change the API or runtime behaviour. There has been no external security audit. Review the crate, your configuration, and the peer metadata trust model before production use."],"features":["With default-features = false, the crate still builds messages, parses metadata, and extracts fields. Signing, verification, and encryption return SamlError::Unsupported.","At most one of crypto-rustcrypto, crypto-aws-lc, and crypto-fips can be selected. Combinations are rejected at compile time. AWS-LC and FIPS are selected with the default features off. crypto-legacy-algorithms,…","Bergshamra supports AWS-LC and FIPS on Linux x8664 and aarch64. This repository's provider tests run on Linux x8664. saml-rs initialises Bergshamra before the first crypto operation.","Initialisation, attestation, unsupported-algorithm, and key-import failures map to SamlError::Crypto. crypto-fips means the selected AWS-LC provider attested FIPS mode. It does not certify the consuming binary or…","XML signatures can be verified against metadata-declared keys."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salasebas/saml-rs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a7fa97144c663be459a6512e0607e2dbf75b30440262015d25826d48a07e8b6e","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.539Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.539Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Pure-Rust SAML 2.0 service provider and identity provider support for browser Web SSO, metadata, and Single Logout. XML-DSig, XML-Enc, C14N, and detached message signatures go through bergshamra. The crate does not need libxml2, xmlsec1, or an OpenSSL build chain.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salasebas/saml-rs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a7fa97144c663be459a6512e0607e2dbf75b30440262015d25826d48a07e8b6e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salasebas/saml-rs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.539Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T06:38:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/salasebas/saml-rs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.540Z","hash":"a7fa97144c663be459a6512e0607e2dbf75b30440262015d25826d48a07e8b6e","originalBytes":11608,"storedBytes":11608,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["metadata","provider","saml","bergshamra","examples","sso","docs","saml-rs","aws-lc","before","default","fips","identity","peer","signed","sso.rs","through","xml","artifact","browser","crate","crypto","idp","logout","opensaml","raw","request","signatures","algorithm","assertion","crypto-bergshamra","detached","does","flow","follow","guides","how","import","need","one","over","presets","read","replay","response","rsa","run","rust","samlify","service","set","single","slo.rs","status","still","trust","validation","api","build","call","capabilities","cargo","change","checks","client","compatibility"